<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head') %></head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/site-header') %>

<section class="hero" style="padding:56px 0 40px">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">⬡ About TrioCraft</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:40px">Transforming physical spaces into immersive brand experiences.</h1>
    <p class="lede">TrioCraft Brands Ltd is a Nairobi-based branding, printing, design, and marketing solutions company — built to manage the complete branding lifecycle from strategy to installation.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <img src="/static/img/site/nairobi-skyline.jpg" alt="Nairobi skyline" style="width:100%;max-height:360px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--r-lg);box-shadow:var(--sh-md)">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;margin-bottom:14px">Our Approach</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:20px">We don't position ourselves as a print shop. We operate as a creative-led branding agency using a curated production network — what our team calls the "Airbnb of branding": we own the process, the creativity, the quality control, and the client experience, while a vetted network of specialist partners handles physical production. That means one accountable team for a business card, an office fit-out, or a full vehicle fleet wrap — never five vendors and five invoices.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 14px">Our Values</h2>
    <div class="svc-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)">
      <div class="svc-card"><h3 style="font-size:16px">Craftsmanship</h3><p>Every detail — paper stock, Pantone match, finish — treated as part of the brand, not an afterthought.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-card"><h3 style="font-size:16px">Brotherhood</h3><p>Long-term partnerships with clients and production partners alike, built on trust.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-card"><h3 style="font-size:16px">Innovation</h3><p>New formats, new materials, new ways to make a space or product say something.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-card"><h3 style="font-size:16px">Quality</h3><p>Vetted, Pantone-matched production partners and a quality check before anything ships.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-card"><h3 style="font-size:16px">Customer-Centricity</h3><p>Real-time order tracking and a single point of contact from brief to delivery.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-card"><h3 style="font-size:16px">Integrity</h3><p>Transparent quotes, honest timelines, no surprises at delivery.</p></div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size:26px;margin:36px 0 14px">Who We Work With</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:16px">TrioCraft delivers institutional-grade branding across government institutions, NGOs &amp; development partners, SMEs &amp; corporates, and political campaigns — see the full <a href="/services" style="color:var(--rust);font-weight:600">Capability Statement</a> for all 11 service categories.</p>

    <div class="cta-band" style="margin-top:32px">
      <h3>"<%= site.tagline %>"</h3>
      <p>That's not a tagline we picked for the website — it's how the team actually works.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Get in Touch →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/site-footer') %>
<%- include('partials/whatsapp-float') %>
</body>
</html>
